  <div class="content">
            <div class="full-width-section page-header-athletics button-slides-master-header-container paragraph paragraph--type--layout-grid paragraph--view-mode--default">
                <div class="layout layout--onecol">
    <div  class="layout__region layout__region--content">
            <div class="paragraph paragraph--type--content-reference-card paragraph--view-mode--default">
              
            <div class="field field--name-field-referenced-content field--type-entity-reference field--label-hidden field__item"><div class="node node--id-306 node--type-athletics-team node--card node--athletics-team-team--card node--view-mode-card slide">
  <div class="parallax-wrap" style="background-image: url(/sites/hfcmain/files/photos/2018/hfc-mens-basketball-2019-dsc06636.jpg)">
  <div class="parallax-title">
    <h1 class="parallax-title-header">Athletics</h1>
    <span class="parallax-title-subheader">Go Hawks!</span>
  </div>
  <div class="header-image-content">
      <div class="billboard-caption-athletics">
        
        <h2><span class="field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden">Men&#039;s Basketball</span>
</h2>
        
        
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-promo-text field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><p>Men's basketball won a conference, state and district championship in 2021 and a berth to the NJCAA National Championship. Men's basketball is the oldest Hawks sport, with a strong history of success.</p></div>
      
        <div class="team-links">
                      <a href="https://mccaa.org/sports/mbkb/2026-27/schedule?teamId=zswwxv2zme2sz6kn" class="hfc-button" target="_blank">Schedule</a>
                                <a href="https://mccaa.org/sports/mbkb/2026-27/teams/henryfordcollege" class="hfc-button" target="_blank">Stats</a>
                                <a href="/athletics/mens-basketball" class="hfc-button" target="_blank">Roster</a>
                  </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</div>
      
          </div>
        <div class="paragraph paragraph--type--content-reference-card paragraph--view-mode--default">
              
            <div class="field field--name-field-referenced-content field--type-entity-reference field--label-hidden field__item"><div class="node node--id-6517 node--type-athletics-team node--card node--athletics-team-team--card node--view-mode-card slide">
  <div class="parallax-wrap" style="background-image: url(/sites/hfcmain/files/photos/2024-10/hfc-womens-basketball-2019-dsc06636.jpg)">
  <div class="parallax-title">
    <h1 class="parallax-title-header">Athletics</h1>
    <span class="parallax-title-subheader">Go Hawks!</span>
  </div>
  <div class="header-image-content">
      <div class="billboard-caption-athletics">
        
        <h2><span class="field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden">Women&#039;s Basketball</span>
</h2>
        
        
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-promo-text field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><p>Women's basketball joined the HFC sports lineup in 2021 and is looking to make an immediate mark in MCCAA conference play.</p></div>
      
        <div class="team-links">
                      <a href="https://mccaa.org/sports/wbkb/2026-27/schedule?teamId=w4xawnaxdh03dfux" class="hfc-button" target="_blank">Schedule</a>
                                <a href="https://mccaa.org/sports/wbkb/2026-27/teams/henryfordcollege" class="hfc-button" target="_blank">Stats</a>
                                <a href="/athletics/womens-basketball" class="hfc-button" target="_blank">Roster</a>
                  </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</div>
      
          </div>
        <div class="paragraph paragraph--type--content-reference-card paragraph--view-mode--default">
              
            <div class="field field--name-field-referenced-content field--type-entity-reference field--label-hidden field__item"><div class="node node--id-303 node--type-athletics-team node--card node--athletics-team-team--card node--view-mode-card slide">
  <div class="parallax-wrap" style="background-image: url(/sites/hfcmain/files/photos/2018/baseball_2crop.jpg)">
  <div class="parallax-title">
    <h1 class="parallax-title-header">Athletics</h1>
    <span class="parallax-title-subheader">Go Hawks!</span>
  </div>
  <div class="header-image-content">
      <div class="billboard-caption-athletics">
        
        <h2><span class="field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden">Baseball</span>
</h2>
        
        
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-promo-text field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><p>HFC’s baseball team won the conference title six consecutive years in the 1990s, and today's team is poised to return to championship form. The Hawks compete from March to May and play home games at The Corner Ballpark in Detroit, MI.</p></div>
      
        <div class="team-links">
                      <a href="https://mccaa.org/sports/bsb/2026-27/schedule?teamId=r3buj65jmvwuqv55" class="hfc-button" target="_blank">Schedule</a>
                                <a href="https://mccaa.org/sports/bsb/2026-27/teams/henryfordcollege" class="hfc-button" target="_blank">Stats</a>
                                <a href="/athletics/baseball" class="hfc-button" target="_blank">Roster</a>
                  </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</div>
      
          </div>
        <div class="paragraph paragraph--type--content-reference-card paragraph--view-mode--default">
              
            <div class="field field--name-field-referenced-content field--type-entity-reference field--label-hidden field__item"><div class="node node--id-305 node--type-athletics-team node--card node--athletics-team-team--card node--view-mode-card slide">
  <div class="parallax-wrap" style="background-image: url(/sites/hfcmain/files/photos/2018/hfc-golf-2019-dsc06636.jpg)">
  <div class="parallax-title">
    <h1 class="parallax-title-header">Athletics</h1>
    <span class="parallax-title-subheader">Go Hawks!</span>
  </div>
  <div class="header-image-content">
      <div class="billboard-caption-athletics">
        
        <h2><span class="field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden">Golf</span>
</h2>
        
        
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-promo-text field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><p>HFC sponsors golf in both the fall and winter semesters. Hawks consistently advance to the regional championship and several have represented HFC at the national level.</p></div>
      
        <div class="team-links">
                      <a href="https://mccaa.org/sports/mgolf/composite" class="hfc-button" target="_blank">Schedule</a>
                                <a href="https://mccaa.org/sports/mgolf/2026-27/statistics" class="hfc-button" target="_blank">Stats</a>
                                <a href="/athletics/golf" class="hfc-button" target="_blank">Roster</a>
                  </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</div>
      
          </div>
        <div class="paragraph paragraph--type--content-reference-card paragraph--view-mode--default">
              
            <div class="field field--name-field-referenced-content field--type-entity-reference field--label-hidden field__item"><div class="node node--id-304 node--type-athletics-team node--card node--athletics-team-team--card node--view-mode-card slide">
  <div class="parallax-wrap" style="background-image: url(/sites/hfcmain/files/photos/2018/1s8a6474crop.jpg)">
  <div class="parallax-title">
    <h1 class="parallax-title-header">Athletics</h1>
    <span class="parallax-title-subheader">Go Hawks!</span>
  </div>
  <div class="header-image-content">
      <div class="billboard-caption-athletics">
        
        <h2><span class="field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden">Softball</span>
</h2>
        
        
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-promo-text field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><p>HFC won a conference and state championship in 2021. Hawks softball players are consistently recognized with top athletic and academic honors throughout the state, region and nation. Softball plays at Heritage Park in Taylor, MI.</p></div>
      
        <div class="team-links">
                      <a href="https://mccaa.org/sports/sball/2026-27/schedule?teamId=oviwgdniurcepd80" class="hfc-button" target="_blank">Schedule</a>
                                <a href="https://mccaa.org/sports/sball/2026-27/teams/henryfordcollege" class="hfc-button" target="_blank">Stats</a>
                                <a href="/athletics/softball" class="hfc-button" target="_blank">Roster</a>
                  </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</div>
      
          </div>
        <div class="paragraph paragraph--type--content-reference-card paragraph--view-mode--default">
              
            <div class="field field--name-field-referenced-content field--type-entity-reference field--label-hidden field__item"><div class="node node--id-309 node--type-athletics-team node--card node--athletics-team-team--card node--view-mode-card slide">
  <div class="parallax-wrap" style="background-image: url(/sites/hfcmain/files/photos/2018/hfc-volleyball-2019-dsc06636.jpg)">
  <div class="parallax-title">
    <h1 class="parallax-title-header">Athletics</h1>
    <span class="parallax-title-subheader">Go Hawks!</span>
  </div>
  <div class="header-image-content">
      <div class="billboard-caption-athletics">
        
        <h2><span class="field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden">Volleyball</span>
</h2>
        
        
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-promo-text field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><p>Volleyball returned to the HFC athletics program in 2016. The season runs from September through November. Home games are played in the Memorial Gym.</p></div>
      
        <div class="team-links">
                      <a href="https://mccaa.org/sports/wvball/2026-27/schedule?teamId=1l5ortdkhyawtsdz" class="hfc-button" target="_blank">Schedule</a>
                                <a href="https://mccaa.org/sports/wvball/2026-27/teams/henryfordcollege" class="hfc-button" target="_blank">Stats</a>
                                <a href="/athletics/volleyball" class="hfc-button" target="_blank">Roster</a>
                  </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</div>
      
          </div>
        <div class="paragraph paragraph--type--content-reference-card paragraph--view-mode--default">
              
            <div class="field field--name-field-referenced-content field--type-entity-reference field--label-hidden field__item"><div class="node node--id-310 node--type-athletics-team node--card node--athletics-team-team--card node--view-mode-card slide">
  <div class="parallax-wrap" style="background-image: url(/sites/hfcmain/files/photos/2018/wrestling_4crop.jpg)">
  <div class="parallax-title">
    <h1 class="parallax-title-header">Athletics</h1>
    <span class="parallax-title-subheader">Go Hawks!</span>
  </div>
  <div class="header-image-content">
      <div class="billboard-caption-athletics">
        
        <h2><span class="field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden">Wrestling</span>
</h2>
        
        
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-promo-text field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><p>Wrestling joined the HFC Varsity lineup in 2018 after a successful run as a Club sport. The program consistently competes at the National Championships level and has produced five All-Americans.</p></div>
      
        <div class="team-links">
                      <a href="https://mccaa.org/sports/wrest/composite" class="hfc-button" target="_blank">Schedule</a>
                                          <a href="/athletics/wrestling" class="hfc-button" target="_blank">Roster</a>
                  </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</div>
      
          </div>
  
    </div>
  </div>

          </div>
  
        <div class="paragraph paragraph--type--layout-grid paragraph--view-mode--default">
                <div class="layout layout--onecol">
    <div  class="layout__region layout__region--content">
            <div class="paragraph paragraph--type--simple-text-area paragraph--view-mode--default">
              
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-long-text field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><h2>Join us to cheer on the Hawks!</h2>

<p>Indoor home competitions are held in the gymnasium of the Athletic Memorial Building on the main HFC campus. <a href="https://www.hfcc.edu/map/">It's Building H on this map</a>. Parking is easy and free in Lot 11 right in front of the gym.</p>

<p>The baseball team plays its home games at The Corner Ballpark in Detroit.<br>
The softball team plays its home games at Heritage Park in Taylor.</p>

<p>Admission to home contests is always free for HFC students and employees.</p>

<h2>Live streaming of Hawks competitions</h2>

<p>Can't attend the game? You may watch live Hawks contests by <a href="https://www.youtube.com/user/henryfordcc">following our live stream on YouTube</a>. The live streams are free of charge.</p></div>
      
          </div>
        <div class="paragraph paragraph--type--simple-text-area paragraph--view-mode--default">
              
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-long-text field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><h2>Purchase your official Hawks Athletics gear</h2>

<p>Parents, students, staff, and supporters can now purchase your official athletics gear to support Hawks! Choose from shirts, hoodies, jackets, and many more items. (<strong><em>Note:</em></strong> The link below will take you to BSN Sports' external website, which does not meet web accessibility standards. If you need assistance, <a href="https://sideline.bsnsports.com/schools/michigan/dearborn/henry-ford-college/customer/contact">contact BSN Sports</a>. Henry Ford College is not responsible for purchases or interactions with BSN Sports.)</p>

<p><a href="https://sideline.bsnsports.com/schools/michigan/dearborn/henry-ford-college" class="hfc-button">Purchase HFC Hawks Gear from BSN Sports</a></p></div>
      
          </div>
        <div class="paragraph paragraph--type--simple-text-area paragraph--view-mode--default">
              
