            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-long-text field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><h2>Sport Camps</h2>

<p>HFC offers sport camps for youth between the ages of 6 to 18. Year-round camps are run by experienced professionals, including HFC varsity coaches, guest coaches, and student-athletes.</p>

