            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-long-text field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><p>THE HFC HAWKS are proud to compete in the Michigan Community College Athletic Association (MCCAA) and Region XII of the National Junior College Athletic Association (NJCAA). Check out <a href="https://www.mccaa.org/landing/index">MCCAA</a> for HFC standings, and <a href="https://www.njcaa.org/landing/index">NJCAA</a> for schedules and team information.</p></div>
      
